# Build-Kontext fuer Wurzelkontext-Images (services/ai, services/crm,
# services/finance, services/inventory, services/workflow). Diese Dienste
# brauchen den Wurzelkontext, weil sie packages/auth-shared ins Image installieren
# (SILENT-FAILURE-20260914). Ohne Ausschluesse wuerde jeder dieser Builds das
# vollstaendige Repository an den Daemon senden.
#
# Regel beim Erweitern: nichts ausschliessen, was ein Dockerfile per COPY
# braucht — also services/*/requirements.txt, services/*/app, services/*/main.py,
# services/*/alembic, services/*/docker-entrypoint.sh und packages/**.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
.claude

node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/storybook-static

__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.venv
**/.venv
venv
**/*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.tox

# Test- und Analyse-Ausgaben: gross, veraenderlich, fuer Images ohne Nutzen
artifacts
coverage
**/coverage
htmlcov
**/htmlcov
.nyc_output
test-results
**/test-results
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
blob-report
evidence
swarm

*.log
*.tmp
*.vhdx
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Only the canonical Studio runtime schema catalog belongs in backend images.
docs/**
!docs/admin/
docs/admin/**
!docs/admin/table-catalog.json
*.md
!README.md
!.oss-scanner/README.md
!.oss-scanner/threat_model.md

# Backend evidence stage needs all Markdown documentation, not host artifacts.
# Keep the prefix identical to .dockerignore (checked by the image contract).
!docs/
!docs/**/
!docs/**/*.md

# Documentation exceptions must not re-admit nested secrets or generated trees.
**/.env*
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/artifacts
**/artifacts/**
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
